==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{arithmetic}} A number or [[expression]] that another is to be divided by.  Eg. in "42 ÷ 3" the divisor is the 3.
# An integer that exactly divides another integer an integer number of times.
#:''The positive '''divisors''' of 6 are 1, 2 and 3.''

